# ============================================================
# RPC — call arbitrary methods on a running RPC server.
# Docs: https://opencode.ai/v2/docs/api
# ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4096

### Call RPC method
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/rpc/{{rpcID}}/{{method}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "params": {}
}

# Replace {{rpcID}} and {{method}} with the actual RPC server id
# and method name for the running tool.